    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 41.778,
      "end": 46.828,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "根据了解，潘燕娥夫妇从事水果种植已经有三十多年了，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "根据了解，潘燕娥夫妇从事水果种植已经有三十多年了。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 47.084,
      "end": 49.632,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "从砂糖橘、沃柑到水蜜桃，",
